OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to escort fire crews in
OL,4,Alatest crackdown on Bonfire Night
OL,5,Adisorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice officers are to be embedded in
OL,8,Ffire stations and will travel with
OL,9,Fcrews to tackle potential attacks on
OL,10,Ffirefighters during Bonfire Night.
OL,12,FThe move is part of Scotland's biggest
OL,13,Fpolice operation since the visit of
OL,14,FPresident Donald Trump last summer and
OL,15,Fa response to a "unique" combination of
OL,16,Fsafety concerns.
OL,18,FAs many as 1,700 officers could be
OL,19,Fdeployed to deal with fireworks-related
OL,20,Fdisorder, a European football match
OL,21,Finvolving Celtic and potential protests
OL,22,Fin Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
